[node name="ScopeCreepBoss" instance=ExtResource("1_base")]
editor_description="Scope Creep, a backpack boss: a storm-blue brute whose greatsword grew a little every sprint, with two thunder mages riding in his backpacks. Up close he swings the greatsword (sometimes twice), from mid range he lunges in with a stab, and he slams the blade down for an electric shockwave. His mages turn in their seats and cast lightning bolts at range; he throws them at the player (they land as thunder mages) and flexes to call new ones."

